              "originalSha256": "63c129cb857fa5922d53df56bd1590b38ce2e363173cdf0c1e1de39d9a30865c",
              "excerpt": "長興元年春正月丙寅朔，帝御明堂殿受朝賀，仗衛如常儀。"
            },
            {
              "chapterId": "old-v041",
              "paragraphId": "old-v041-p19",
              "originalRevision": 1,
              "originalSha256": "853334cbae19709081c5b7272fe27c34d9dbfe988c642489c7beff9f7b4f9b37",
              "excerpt": "庚午，應州節度使張敬達移雲州，以捧聖都指揮使、守恩州刺史沙彥詢為應州節度使；"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "yearRange": {
        "start": 933,
        "end": 936
      }
    },
